id":216296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjI5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar","html_url":"https://github.com/IgorMinar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IgorMinar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":681,"closed_issues":22796,"state":"open","created_at":"2018-01-18T16:52:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T09:12:24Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2022-04-20T14:20:31Z","updated_at":"2023-04-06T00:08:10Z","closed_at":"2023-03-06T18:45:09Z","assignee":{"login":"JiaLiPassion","id":1442575,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI1NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion","html_url":"https://github.com/JiaLiPassion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiaLiPassion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Which @angular/* package(s) are the source of the bug?\r\n\r\ncore\r\n\r\n### Is this a regression?\r\n\r\nNo\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nWe can use `ngZoneEventCoalescing` to group change detection cycles of events into an animationFrame\r\nSo if we have a listener like this on a component that appears multiple times in the dom\r\n\r\n```\r\n  @HostListener('document:keydown', ['$event'])\r\n  onKeydown(event: KeyboardEvent) {\r\n    ...\r\n  }\r\n```\r\nthere is only one change detection cycle triggered on each keydown event\r\n\r\nbut if we now specify the key, we loose this effect and there is one change detection cycle per component\r\n```\r\n  @HostListener('document:keydown.a')\r\n  onKeydown() {\r\n    ...\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n\r\nI've provided a stackblitz link with both variations in the `BoxComponent` and added logging for the change detection cycles to the console.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Please provide a link to a minimal reproduction of the bug\r\n\r\nhttps://stackblitz.com/edit/angular-ivy-qza2cj?file=src%2Fmain.ts\r\n\r\n### Please provide the exception or error you saw\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Please provide the environment you discovered this bug in (run `ng version`)\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Anything else?\r\n\r\nI guess the key event manager plugin causes the cycles here \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/angular/angular/blob/b5ab7aff433a67cddaa55e621d17b1a1b07b57c2/packages/platform-browser/src/dom/events/key_events.ts#L176-L182\r\n\r\nif we activate the `ngZoneRunCoalescing` flag as well, then we have the desired behaviour again.\r\nthe question is if the event plugin should be modified so that it already applies to the `ngZoneEventCoalescing` flag like one would expect from the name.\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"jessicajaniuk","id":72768744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzY4NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72768744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk","html_url":"https://github.com/jessicajaniuk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/45698/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/45698/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}